(7047219, 1071672, 39057, '<td valign="top">Although this is a great pic and meets the challenge, I can''t give over a four score. Why? Because the pants are too baggy. It seems you could have waited there for awhile longer (like a pro would do) and wait for a well endowed female or male to come along. Tight well fitting jeans would have made this photo an eight, but as it is I will only give a four. If you think I''m nuts, you''re right, I''m pulling your leg. You get an eight.</td>', 'Although this is a great pic and meets the challenge, I can''t give over a four score. Why? Because the pants are too baggy. It seems you could have waited there for awhile longer (like a pro would do) and wait for a well endowed female or male to come along. Tight well fitting jeans would have made this photo an eight, but as it is I will only give a four. If you think I''m nuts, you''re right, I''m pulling your leg. You get an eight.', '2013-06-03 11:19:25.000000', NULL, 1),
