(7047222, 1071702, 39057, '<td valign="top">I would have given you  a six if there would have been grass on the ground. Out of all the swing sets in the area, you''re telling me you could not find one that had grass or in fact, even some color in the area? lol. Just joking. A six from me.</td>', 'I would have given you  a six if there would have been grass on the ground. Out of all the swing sets in the area, you''re telling me you could not find one that had grass or in fact, even some color in the area? lol. Just joking. A six from me.', '2013-06-03 11:22:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7047223, 1071537, 39057, '<td valign="top">Hmmm...nice shot but how do you know, or how am I supposed to know that this is a 30 pound ray at the time the photo was taken? It''s very dubious to list the weight of the ray in a photo before you even know what the weight is. I would have given a six to this photo but because you tried to inflate my enthusiasm, I will only give a three. If you believe that, then you''ll believe any DP fish story. Six from me.</td>', 'Hmmm...nice shot but how do you know, or how am I supposed to know that this is a 30 pound ray at the time the photo was taken? It''s very dubious to list the weight of the ray in a photo before you even know what the weight is. I would have given a six to this photo but because you tried to inflate my enthusiasm, I will only give a three. If you believe that, then you''ll believe any DP fish story. Six from me.', '2013-06-03 11:28:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7047224, 1071700, 39057, '<td valign="top">Very nice but I can only give a four. Why? Because the bubble look like eyes that may or may not be stalking this young lady. When I see photos that take advantage of women by portraying them as sexual objects for all eyes to see, I automatically score down to a three. Of course this is a joke comment but I bet you were about to burst a vein. Seven from me.</td>', 'Very nice but I can only give a four. Why? Because the bubble look like eyes that may or may not be stalking this young lady. When I see photos that take advantage of women by portraying them as sexual objects for all eyes to see, I automatically score down to a three. Of course this is a joke comment but I bet you were about to burst a vein. Seven from me.', '2013-06-03 11:31:20.000000', NULL, 1),
